{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27055","headline":"从军行 · 姚合","name":"从军行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"滥得进士名，才用苦不长。\n性癖艺亦独，十年作诗章。\n六义虽粗成，名字犹未扬。\n将军俯招引，遣脱儒衣裳。\n常恐虚受恩，不惯把刀枪。\n又无远筹略，坐使虏灭亡。\n昨来发兵师，各各赴战场。\n顾我同老弱，不得随戎行。\n丈夫生世间，职分贵所当。\n从军不出门，岂异病在牀。\n谁不恋其家，其家无风霜。\n鹰鹘念搏击，岂贵食满肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27055.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27055","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}